  61:     - If the embedded marker color also appears as a separate isolated control pixel,
  62:       translate the whole sprite so the body L-bend lands on that control pixel.
  63:     - Clear each moved sprite from its old position, clear its consumed control pixel,
  64:       then paste all translated sprites; sprites without a matching control stay put.
  65: 
  66:     Key insight
  67:     - The marker color pairs a sprite with its destination control, while the L-bend
